## Human-in-the-Loop Checkpoints

| Checkpoint | Phase | What is reviewed | Blockers |
|-----------|-------|-----------------|----------|
| Sheet selection | Cleaning | Which sheets to clean, whether to append matching headers | None — the user picks |
| Bronze plan review | Bronze | Source system, period, table name, action (create/append/replace/evolve) per output | `REPLACE`, `EVOLVE`, `NEW_TABLE` require explicit confirmation |
| Silver mapping review | Silver | Bronze column → Silver column mapping for every column, with quality preview | Every column must be mapped or explicitly ignored |

